Subject: Re: Phylogenetic meta-analysis: model optimization and WAIC calculation
Message-ID: <hfUhy3OtyVo.s61GKUz1BwAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <hfUhy3OtyVo.6rFyqp7BBwAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
