It would be really nice to have an easy way of implementing mini-batches (even nicer if it could be done in pyStan).

The method described in https://github.com/stan-dev/stan/blob/adsvi/how_to_ADSVI.md works for me, but I automated it with a script that must know data variable names, and the right place in the compiled model's .hpp file, etc. so it is ugly and difficult to maintain when trying several models.

