Doesn't matter. von_mises_lpdf just gives the height of the pdf at the point y given the parameters offset & kappa. Actually, it gives the log of the height, so you'll want to do "amp*exp(von_mises_lpdf(y|offset,kappa)"

--
Mike Lawrence
Graduate Student
Department of Psychology & Neuroscience
Dalhousie University

