Subject: Re: How is standard error in elpd calculated in LOO package?
Message-ID: <1OGlEHMUpec.96I0iY6ZCQAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <1OGlEHMUpec.4Pp1_hdCCQAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
References: <1OGlEHMUpec.4Pp1_hdCCQAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
