Subject: Re: [stan-users] Slow mixing and poor estimation in multivariate state-space model with multinomial observations
Message-ID: <rggafTrmCvA.IXXzofg7CwAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <rggafTrmCvA.IQ_V90e5CgAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
