We have our own recommendations for covariance.  Many
systems were stuck with inverse Wisharts for covariance
(or Wisharts for precision matrices) because of the
conjugacy.  We prefer scaled LKJ priors as they make more
sense from a modeling perspective in most cases.

- Bob

> On Dec 14, 2016, at 9:33 PM, Devin Pastoor <devin....@gmail.com> wrote:
