Subject: Conditional Ordered Logistic Regression
Message-ID: <JWOMg4VkkR8.Gk2fA088DwAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/stan-users/c/JWOMg4VkkR8/m/Gk2fA088DwAJ>
